    "text": "We say that a group G is rational if any two elements x, y ∈ G satisfying\n⟨x⟩ = ⟨y⟩ are conjugate. Is it true that for any d there exist only finitely many finite\nrational d-generated 2-groups?                                        A. Jaikin-Zapirain",
